### products.rest

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ✅ GET tutti i prodotti
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### ✅ POST crea prodotto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Laptop" }

### 💥 409 Conflict — nome duplicato (esegui dopo quello sopra)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Laptop" }

### ✅ GET prodotto esistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 💥 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/9999

### 💥 400 Bad Request — id non numerico (ParseIntPipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/abc

### ✅ DELETE prodotto esistente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 💥 403 Forbidden — id speciale 999
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/999

### 💥 404 Not Found in delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/9999